you to cast with this feature. [...] The number of spells on your list increases as you gain Paladin levels, as shown in the Prepared Spells column of the Paladin Features table."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"set_spellcasting_ability","justification":"The feature sets Charisma as the spellcasting ability, which governs spell attack rolls and spell save DCs. There is no surface concept for this at all — it is neither a ClassFeatureEffect nor a scaling node.","evidence":"Spellcasting Ability. Charisma is your spellcasting ability for your Paladin spells."}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["no content/paladin_spellcasting_l1.json authored; accepted self-report-only widening path"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0}
