es daily at dawn."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"DcSource: fixed numeric DC","justification":"DcSource supports caster_spell_save_dc and weapon_attack_dc only. The Cube of Force specifies a fixed save DC of 17 that does not derive from the user's stats — requires a new { kind: 'fixed'; value: number } variant.","evidence":"thereby cast the spell associated with it (save DC 17)"},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"RestResetCadence: daily_at_dawn_dice","justification":"RestResetCadence covers short_rest, long_rest, short_or_long_rest, and partial_short_full_long. A daily recharge that yields a random dice amount (1d6) at a fixed real-time cadence (dawn) is not a rest event and cannot be expressed with the current union.","evidence":"it regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn"}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["no content/magic_item_cube_of_force.json authored; accepted self-report-only widening path"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0}
