ant for it. The closest effect in ClassFeatureEffect is grant_extra_action or heal_hp; neither represents a slot refund.","evidence":"the slot isn't expended"}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["no content/feat_boon_of_spell_recall.json authored; accepted self-report-only widening path"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0}
